OL,3,AWarrants used to search Andrew's homes
OL,4,Awere unlawful, court says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police has accepted
OL,7,Fwarrants it used to search Andrew
OL,8,FMountbatten-Windsor's homes at the time
OL,9,Fof his arrest in February were
OL,10,Funlawful, the High Court has heard.
OL,12,FFollowing Thursday's ruling items
OL,13,Fseized in the raids will continue to be
OL,14,Fheld by the police until a hearing in
OL,15,F2027, and the criminal investigation
OL,16,Finto Mountbatten-Windsor is ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
