OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWarrants used to search Andrew's homes
OL,4,Awere unlawful, court says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former prince, who denies any
OL,7,Fwrongdoing, was arrested by police on
OL,8,F19 February on suspicion of misconduct
OL,9,Fin public office, and has since
OL,10,Flaunched a challenge over the legality
OL,11,Fof the search warrants.
OL,13,FThe force said it accepted that the
OL,14,F"initial court's decision to issue
OL,15,Fwarrants under the specific piece of
OL,16,Flegislation used was incorrect" before
OL,17,Fthey searched the properties.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
